                "severity": "WARNING",
                "claim": "removeHooks now scans Stop. Only the review stop-hook entry is removed, and the unit test covers an older sync-trigger entry plus a foreign entry on Stop. The case where the same list also holds a drifted or older-format review stop-hook entry is not tested: reviewStopFamily.owns decides whether that entry is removed on Uninstall, and no test pins this. Low risk, since the family implementation is shared with the other families.",
